    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawlers of the West: Prologue is a western realistic physics-based fighting game. This is the limited version of the\u00a0game. You can play the first boss of the game. Some game modes like multiplayer is not available in this\u00a0prologue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics Based Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can throw different punches and kicks or you can grapple your opponent in combat. You can also grab glass bottles and swing or throw them to your enemies. Characters have active physics and ragdoll system all the time so all the characters reacts to hits realistically, you can even hit the pianist or the bartender. Damage is depend on physics as well so timing your punches and positioning your character is very important. You can also block your opponent's attacks but if you can't position your character well a punch can hit you. Use the environment to your advantage is also important since there are lots of bottles chairs and table in the saloon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has different stats and this will change your gameplay. For example you can pick a character with high stamina and punch your opponents all the time or you can play with a character that can punch hard. In this\u00a0prologue some characters is not available to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawlers of the West: Prologue is a western realistic physics-based fighting game. This is the limited version of the\u00a0game. You can play the first boss of the game. Some game modes like multiplayer is not available in this\u00a0prologue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics Based Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can throw different punches and kicks or you can grapple your opponent in combat. You can also grab glass bottles and swing or throw them to your enemies. Characters have active physics and ragdoll system all the time so all the characters reacts to hits realistically, you can even hit the pianist or the bartender. Damage is depend on physics as well so timing your punches and positioning your character is very important. You can also block your opponent's attacks but if you can't position your character well a punch can hit you. Use the environment to your advantage is also important since there are lots of bottles chairs and table in the saloon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has different stats and this will change your gameplay. For example you can pick a character with high stamina and punch your opponents all the time or you can play with a character that can punch hard. In this\u00a0prologue some characters is not available to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
